## 2. Registered agent

State-side designation and agent-side consent are **separate evidence**. A state record showing an
agent does not prove the agent agreed to serve, and an engagement letter does not prove the state
was told.

| Item | Value | Evidence | Date | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Agent named on the state's record | <AGENT> | <PATH> | <DATE> | |
| Agent's written consent / engagement | <YES/NO> | <PATH> | <DATE> | |
| Agent's registered office address | <ADDRESS> | <PATH> | <DATE> | |
| Prior agent(s) and the change instrument | <AGENT, DATES> | <PATH> | <DATE> | |

